B.a2n=new A.iK(5,14,7,1,"En mucositis los protocolos se estudian a menudo con aplicacion diaria o casi diaria durante los dias de mayor carga de sintomas. Una ventana util es de 5-14 sesiones.","For mucositis, protocols are often studied with daily or near-daily application during the highest symptom-burden days. A useful window is 5-14 sessions.")
B.a2o=new A.iK(8,18,12,2,"Las series para rodilla degenerativa o sobreuso suelen necesitar continuidad durante varias semanas para valorar dolor y funcion. Una ventana razonable es de 8-18 sesiones.","Knee protocols for degenerative pain or overload usually need continuity across several weeks before pain and function can be judged. A reasonable window is 8-18 sessions.")
B.a2p=new A.iK(8,12,10,2,"Los protocolos de contorno corporal suelen necesitar varias sesiones seriadas y suelen interpretarse junto con ejercicio y adherencia nutricional.","Body-contouring protocols usually need several serial sessions and are typically interpreted alongside exercise and nutritional adherence.")
B.a2q=new A.iK(8,16,12,2,"Los protocolos esteticos y de remodelacion dermica suelen aplicarse 2-4 veces por semana y requieren varias semanas para apreciar cambios acumulativos.","Aesthetic and dermal-remodelling protocols are usually applied 2-4 times per week and need several weeks before cumulative changes become visible.")
B.a2r=new A.iK(4,12,8,2,"En dolor muscular localizado y puntos gatillo la evidencia suele emplear bloques breves y reevaluacion rapida. Una serie conservadora es de 4-12 sesiones.","For local muscular pain and trigger points, the evidence usually uses short blocks with early reassessment. A conservative course is 4-12 sessions.")
B.a2s=new A.iK(8,20,12,2,"En cicatriz, fibrosis y tejido reparativo suele interesar un curso mantenido con seguimiento del tejido y tolerancia local. Planifica 8-20 sesiones como marco orientativo.","For scar, fibrosis and reparative tissue goals, a sustained course with tissue and tolerance follow-up is usually more meaningful. Plan 8-20 sessions as a working range.")
B.a2t=new A.iK(12,24,15,2,"Los protocolos transcraneales exploratorios suelen estudiarse como ciclos prolongados y consistentes. Si se planifica un curso, conviene pensar en al menos 12 sesiones.","Exploratory transcranial protocols are usually studied as longer, consistent cycles. If you plan a full course, it is sensible to think in terms of at least 12 sessions.")
B.a2u=new A.iK(8,12,10,2,"En cefalea y migrana la literatura disponible suele evaluar bloques repetidos de varias semanas, con ajuste segun respuesta y tolerancia neurosensorial.","For headache and migraine, the available literature usually evaluates repeated blocks across several weeks, adjusted according to response and neurosensory tolerance.")
